    "summary": "- DELETE /v1/customers/{id} soft-deletes at the service clock and returns 204, or 409 `has_active_subscriptions` when a subscription is not canceled. A deleted customer returns 404 everywhere in the API, and its email is free for reuse.\n- Invoices and payments stay readable, and the invoice customer shows `deleted: true`. POST /v1/customers/{id}/restore works within 30 days, with 409 `email_taken` on a conflict. `store.PurgeDeletedCustomers(now)` removes customers deleted more than 30 days before `now` and returns the count.\n- `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...` pass, and new \n...[truncated]",
